00:54:47.500 --> 00:54:48.500
Beneran?

00:54:52.700 --> 00:54:55.000
Mungkin karena tadi baru pertama kalinya ya.

00:54:55.700 --> 00:54:57.866
Aku jadi bersemangat. Maksudnya apa?

00:54:58.566 --> 00:54:59.566
Udah kering belum?

00:55:07.700 --> 00:55:09.566
Aku sih sekarang lagi menikmati.

00:55:10.600 --> 00:55:11.600
Kapan pun.

00:55:12.100 --> 00:55:12.266
Eh?

00:55:12.433 --> 00:55:13.433
Seriusan?

00:55:14.400 --> 00:55:15.400
Iya.

00:55:24.800 --> 00:55:25.800
Iya.

00:55:26.166 --> 00:55:42.666
Ya. Lino-san. Mau *yobai*?

00:55:44.433 --> 00:55:50.200
Tadi sempat tidur, terus pas bangun, kupikir mungkin udah agak mendingan.

00:55:51.800 --> 00:55:52.800
Iya.

00:55:54.000 --> 00:55:55.000
Iya.

00:57:14.233 --> 00:57:15.233
Ah,

00:57:32.233 --> 00:57:49.700
Mmh, mmh, mmh, beneran keluar?

00:57:49.800 --> 00:57:56.966
Mmh, mmh, mmh, mmh, ah, beneran keluar?

00:57:57.000 --> 00:57:59.100
Iya, iya, iya, ah, keluar.

00:57:59.233 --> 00:58:00.233
Iya.

00:58:00.600 --> 00:58:01.600
Iya.

00:58:02.133 --> 00:58:03.300
Iya. Mmh...

00:58:06.866 --> 00:58:08.300
Mmh...

00:58:13.333 --> 00:58:17.166
Mmh, mmh, mmh, mmh...

00:58:20.900 --> 00:58:21.900
Mmh...

00:58:24.600 --> 00:58:28.200
Mmh... Keliatan.

00:58:29.800 --> 00:58:31.933
Hebat, warnanya masih putih bersih.

00:58:32.500 --> 00:58:42.933
Ngeluarin sebanyak ini. Hebat. Mau tidur?

00:58:45.933 --> 00:58:47.166
Beneran?

00:58:47.566 --> 00:58:50.466
Iya, kurasa aku udah bisa tidur sekarang. Sungguh?

00:58:50.566 --> 00:58:57.500
Yah, mungkin nanti mau lagi sih setelah bangun.
Nggak mau "yobai" lagi?

00:58:57.666 --> 00:58:59.700
Hahaha, aku bakal beneran tidur kok.

00:59:01.433 --> 00:59:03.633
Kalau gitu, mari tidur. Selamat malam.

00:59:03.800 --> 00:59:04.800
Selamat malam.
